{
  "description": "Castle build-and-defend siege: thin organism composing the std-tactics-board-2d frame + std-score, plus three organism-level traits (CastleClock / CastleEconomy / CastleWaves) that turn the turn-based frame into a real-time siege — a 2s clock auto-advances turns, workers harvest gold at the mines, gold raises watchtowers on the mine plots, and raider waves stream out of a boxed war portal down the north corridor. Win by destroying the portal and every raider; lose when the whole garrison, keep included, is wiped.",
